OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers across Tayside this evening,
OL,7,Fotherwise dry. Then the rest of the
OL,8,Fnight will be dry with lengthy clear
OL,9,Fperiods. A cold night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FAfter a quite chilly start in
OL,12,Fplaces it will be a dry day with
OL,13,Fbright or sunny spells and light winds.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,16,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,17,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,18,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,19,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,20,Frain likely later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
